cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vp-oxphos: mitochondrial membrane-potential disruption prediction"
message: "If you use this package, please cite it and the underlying Tox21 data."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sagace Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sagace-Labs/vp-oxphos"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "2.0.0"
abstract: >-
  A predictor of mitochondrial membrane-potential disruption and of the
  cell-viability loss it is confounded with, from molecular structure.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - drug-induced liver injury
  - mitochondrial toxicity
  - OXPHOS
  - Tox21
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Identification of small molecules that disrupt mitochondrial membrane
      potential in the Tox21 10K compound library
    authors:
      - family-names: Attene-Ramos
        given-names: Matias S.
    journal: "Environmental Health Perspectives"
    year: 2015
    doi: "10.1289/ehp.1408642"
